// Runtime UI string lookup. Singleton — bind every text/label/hint to
// `I18n.t("some.key")` and flipping `AppController.language` will repaint
// every dependent binding automatically (Q_PROPERTY change → JS reads
// `lang` → reads dict[lang] → returns new string).
//
// Keys are stable; if a key is missing in the active table we fall back to
// the EN form, and if missing there too we return the key itself so a
// regression is loud rather than silent.
